1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire
Knight of the Ribbon

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Knight of the Ribbon,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Forty-First Episode
The Secret Letter
Cheeky Teppi

15
00:02:03,032 --> 00:02:06,743
Lord Sapphire, you've been doing nothing but reading letters lately,

16
00:02:06,775 --> 00:02:08,824
but that won't help your studies!

17
00:02:15,010 --> 00:02:17,160
Today, we shall study mathematics.

18
00:02:17,311 --> 00:02:20,274
To begin with, the first person to establish a school of mathematics

19
00:02:20,298 --> 00:02:23,180
was Archimedes, the great Roman...

20
00:02:23,280 --> 00:02:25,820
Wrong! That was Pythagoras of Greece!

21
00:02:27,080 --> 00:02:30,860
I was merely testing you. It's common knowledge...

22
00:02:31,060 --> 00:02:34,608
A letter from Prince Franz has arrived!

23
00:02:36,805 --> 00:02:37,805
Oh, another one?

24
00:02:46,610 --> 00:02:47,880
Eyes, right!

25
00:03:17,490 --> 00:03:19,940
Thanks, you're a good boy.

26
00:03:27,040 --> 00:03:29,280
Now, hurry and take this reply, Gor!

27
00:03:58,423 --> 00:04:00,096
I hope Gor comes back soon.

28
00:04:04,060 --> 00:04:05,460
I know, I'll go meet Gor!

29
00:04:05,849 --> 00:04:07,100
Oh, sorry!

30
00:04:10,184 --> 00:04:11,340
What was that about?

31
00:04:11,510 --> 00:04:14,000
Prince Franz has been acting a bit strange lately.

32
00:04:14,179 --> 00:04:16,166
Sitting at his desk every day...

33
00:04:16,190 --> 00:04:19,560
Studying? Isn't that wonderful?

34
00:04:20,360 --> 00:04:21,980
As expected of my nephew.

35
00:04:23,119 --> 00:04:23,901
A letter.

36
00:04:23,925 --> 00:04:27,510
Lord Chanel, this looks rather suspicious.

37
00:04:28,380 --> 00:04:30,060
Could it be a letter from a girl?

38
00:04:30,255 --> 00:04:32,460
No, this isn't a bad thing.

39
00:04:32,915 --> 00:04:37,100
It happens to everyone when they're young. It's quite wonderful, really.

40
00:04:37,545 --> 00:04:41,440
Still, who on earth could he be writing this to...?

41
00:05:01,454 --> 00:05:04,463
Is it true that Silverland and Goldland

42
00:05:04,487 --> 00:05:08,100
have been secretly communicating lately?

43
00:05:08,148 --> 00:05:10,870
A small dog has been crossing the border.

44
00:05:12,098 --> 00:05:17,500
They might be planning a joint attack against our kingdom.

45
00:05:18,765 --> 00:05:20,480
There it comes! Look!

46
00:05:25,829 --> 00:05:30,180
Yes, no doubt about it. It's carrying a silver letter in its mouth.

47
00:05:31,740 --> 00:05:35,400
Yes, that is undoubtedly a secret message from Silverland.

48
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:37,700
Quick, catch that dog!

49
00:05:53,553 --> 00:05:57,138
How wonderful! Hang in there, little doggy! He beat them again!

50
00:06:06,850 --> 00:06:09,080
Who goes there! How dare you trespass on Goldland's territory!

51
00:06:09,239 --> 00:06:11,109
Stop! Get them!

52
00:06:33,236 --> 00:06:33,915
You wanna go?

53
00:06:34,712 --> 00:06:36,251
Help!

54
00:06:41,110 --> 00:06:42,793
This'll do.

55
00:06:49,376 --> 00:06:52,658
Wonderful, he's incredible! Papa, who is that?

56
00:06:53,243 --> 00:06:56,079
Prince Franz of Goldland.

57
00:06:56,384 --> 00:06:59,767
Oh, so that gentleman is Prince Franz. How wonderful... he's incredible!

58
00:06:59,814 --> 00:07:00,392
What?

59
00:07:00,493 --> 00:07:02,822
Papa, I want to marry Franz.

60
00:07:03,930 --> 00:07:09,545
I want to be his wife, I want to, I want to! I want to so badly, no matter what!

61
00:07:13,005 --> 00:07:14,920
No! No!

62
00:07:17,820 --> 00:07:20,880
I don't want sweets! I want Franz!

63
00:07:23,555 --> 00:07:24,940
I told you no...

64
00:07:26,030 --> 00:07:28,280
I hate dolls!

65
00:07:28,955 --> 00:07:32,620
It has to be the real Prince Franz! No, no, no!

66
00:07:32,705 --> 00:07:35,880
I don't want a castle, and I don't want the moon!

67
00:07:36,285 --> 00:07:38,500
Franz is the only one I love!

68
00:07:41,906 --> 00:07:44,340
Goodness, what an impatient daughter.

69
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:48,220
Why not just give Teppi to Prince Franz?

70
00:07:49,379 --> 00:07:50,314
Who are you?!

71
00:07:52,200 --> 00:07:58,360
Don't be surprised. We go wherever Lord X commands.

72
00:07:58,760 --> 00:07:59,760
What!?

73
00:08:00,705 --> 00:08:04,679
Orders from the X-Union. Propose marriage to Franz.

74
00:08:05,098 --> 00:08:08,480
Franz loves Sapphire, so he'll never agree.

75
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:10,759
Then, Charcoal,

76
00:08:10,783 --> 00:08:15,667
you'll have an excuse to destroy Goldland for insulting your daughter.

77
00:08:15,967 --> 00:08:19,640
And if by any chance he says yes, invite him to this castle...

78
00:08:24,420 --> 00:08:29,439
...and kill him. Either way, Goldland will be ours.

79
00:08:33,760 --> 00:08:38,384
The X-Union's expansion to the west faces one main obstacle:

80
00:08:38,408 --> 00:08:41,500
Goldland. To the north lies Silverland.

81
00:08:43,021 --> 00:08:47,438
Join the X-Union or suffer the same fate as Gold and Silver.

82
00:08:47,572 --> 00:08:49,940
The choice is yours, Charcoal.

83
00:08:50,183 --> 00:08:52,060
Though it's entirely up to you.

84
00:09:06,155 --> 00:09:09,690
My, my, when on earth did those two fall in love?

85
00:09:10,560 --> 00:09:11,633
I'm astonished.

86
00:09:11,931 --> 00:09:14,477
To think King Charcoal's only daughter, Princess Teppi,

87
00:09:14,501 --> 00:09:17,368
has proposed to Prince Franz...

88
00:09:17,392 --> 00:09:20,067
Lord Chanel, what about that letter from before...?

89
00:09:20,750 --> 00:09:24,540
Ah, right! So the person he was writing to was Princess Teppi?

90
00:09:24,714 --> 00:09:25,464
Uncle!

91
00:09:26,809 --> 00:09:27,809
Did you call for me?

92
00:09:28,812 --> 00:09:29,532
Franz,

93
00:09:29,556 --> 00:09:32,821
I actually have wonderful news for you today.

94
00:09:33,142 --> 00:09:38,053
The person you wrote to every day has proposed marriage to you!

95
00:09:39,439 --> 00:09:41,555
Is that true, Uncle?!

96
00:09:42,407 --> 00:09:43,438
Of course!

97
00:09:43,462 --> 00:09:49,080
Why would I object to the person you love?

98
00:09:49,172 --> 00:09:50,860
Thank you, Uncle!

99
00:09:51,306 --> 00:09:52,538
Come on, Gor, let's go!

100
00:10:18,680 --> 00:10:19,399
Sapphire,

101
00:10:20,079 --> 00:10:23,403
I'm sure you're looking at this beautiful moon, too...

102
00:10:31,509 --> 00:10:32,880
What a beautiful moon...

103
00:10:37,019 --> 00:10:40,240
Aren't you lonely, all by yourself?

104
00:11:06,969 --> 00:11:09,727
Prince Franz, I'll be able to see you tomorrow, won't I?

105
00:11:18,459 --> 00:11:21,792
Lord Charcoal has arrived!

106
00:11:26,889 --> 00:11:27,876
Hurry it up.

107
00:11:28,032 --> 00:11:30,527
The princess should be here by now.

108
00:11:31,699 --> 00:11:32,938
Please wait just a moment longer.

109
00:11:33,197 --> 00:11:36,357
After all, today we are showing you off in your finest attire.

110
00:11:37,870 --> 00:11:39,923
Apologies for keeping you waiting.

111
00:11:39,947 --> 00:11:41,640
Franz will be here shortly as well.

112
00:11:42,520 --> 00:11:45,407
Franz must be feeling shy.

113
00:11:45,603 --> 00:11:48,420
He's loved her for so long, after all.

114
00:11:51,859 --> 00:11:54,017
Presenting Prince Franz!

115
00:12:06,200 --> 00:12:07,200
Sapphire...

116
00:12:10,958 --> 00:12:11,557
You are...

117
00:12:14,109 --> 00:12:17,500
It's Teppi. Franz, you remembered me!

118
00:12:17,995 --> 00:12:20,560
I've been thinking of you the whole time, too.

119
00:12:20,820 --> 00:12:22,729
I love you. I love you so much.

120
00:12:22,925 --> 00:12:24,337
More than Papa, more than Mama,

121
00:12:24,517 --> 00:12:26,965
more than the castle, more than the moon.

122
00:12:27,240 --> 00:12:30,008
So much more, forever and ever!

123
00:12:30,529 --> 00:12:32,993
Teppi, you're... you're...

124
00:12:33,509 --> 00:12:35,251
Yes, it's all right, Franz.

125
00:12:35,439 --> 00:12:38,638
Everyone understands. You don't have to say a word.

126
00:12:39,617 --> 00:12:41,120
That's not it! That's not it at all!

127
00:12:46,009 --> 00:12:47,540
That's not it, Teppi. Forgive me.

128
00:12:48,160 --> 00:12:49,261
Franz!

129
00:12:51,443 --> 00:12:52,219
Papa!

130
00:12:52,799 --> 00:12:53,428
Unforgivable!

131
00:12:53,734 --> 00:12:55,040
Our nation has been insulted!

132
00:12:55,539 --> 00:12:59,860
For the honor of our kingdom, I hereby declare war on Goldland!

133
00:13:03,356 --> 00:13:04,200
Papa!

134
00:13:04,560 --> 00:13:05,560
This means war!

135
00:13:05,650 --> 00:13:06,650
No!

136
00:13:07,310 --> 00:13:08,480
No! You can't!

137
00:13:08,695 --> 00:13:10,296
I said no! No!

138
00:13:11,273 --> 00:13:12,234
Franz!

139
00:13:12,382 --> 00:13:13,304
Franz!

140
00:13:13,343 --> 00:13:14,992
Franz!

141
00:13:18,129 --> 00:13:19,160
Forgive me, Teppi.

142
00:14:15,319 --> 00:14:17,876
Report! Report!

143
00:14:21,479 --> 00:14:24,251
My Lord! Goldland River has fallen into enemy hands!

144
00:14:26,540 --> 00:14:28,106
Report!

145
00:14:28,138 --> 00:14:30,106
West Gold Castle has fallen to the enemy!

146
00:14:30,130 --> 00:14:32,987
Our forces... our forces have been wiped out!

147
00:14:34,539 --> 00:14:36,161
The enemy is moving too fast!

148
00:14:36,450 --> 00:14:38,880
King Charcoal must have been preparing for this all along!

149
00:14:39,425 --> 00:14:41,247
The marriage proposal was a trap!

150
00:14:41,271 --> 00:14:43,820
We fell right into their trap!

151
00:14:44,800 --> 00:14:45,403
Uncle,

152
00:14:45,427 --> 00:14:47,762
at this rate, Goldland will be destroyed!

153
00:14:48,028 --> 00:14:49,348
Everyone will be killed!

154
00:14:49,630 --> 00:14:51,059
We must do something.

155
00:14:51,083 --> 00:14:53,769
But surrender is out of the question!

156
00:14:54,509 --> 00:14:57,384
Fight to the end for the honor of Goldland!

157
00:15:09,325 --> 00:15:10,325
Gor, Gor!

158
00:15:13,149 --> 00:15:16,825
Goru, take this letter to Sapphire. And hurry!

159
00:15:39,599 --> 00:15:42,743
A messenger from Prince Franz has arrived!

160
00:15:43,785 --> 00:15:44,613
Gor!

161
00:15:46,979 --> 00:15:49,960
What? Charcoalland has launched an invasion!

162
00:15:50,860 --> 00:15:51,924
Charcoalland...

163
00:15:53,600 --> 00:15:53,640
Gorun!

164
00:15:54,490 --> 00:15:56,317
I was careless, Sapphire.

165
00:15:57,021 --> 00:15:59,620
I even dragged Teppi into this.

166
00:16:00,539 --> 00:16:03,100
In the end, this was all my fault.

167
00:16:04,320 --> 00:16:07,817
Sapphire, I must head to the northern fort now.

168
00:16:08,356 --> 00:16:09,580
Please don't worry.

169
00:16:10,545 --> 00:16:11,426
If you come,

170
00:16:11,450 --> 00:16:13,660
Silverland will be dragged into the war as well.

171
00:16:16,600 --> 00:16:18,770
Franz... Poor Franz...

172
00:16:20,325 --> 00:16:21,036
I know!

173
00:16:21,606 --> 00:16:22,223
Gor!

174
00:16:22,247 --> 00:16:24,637
Go on ahead and protect Franz!

175
00:16:24,661 --> 00:16:26,100
I'll follow right behind you!

176
00:16:42,360 --> 00:16:43,360
What are you doing?

177
00:16:44,540 --> 00:16:47,452
Hurry, take him to the Black Knight's haunted lair!

178
00:16:50,389 --> 00:16:52,341
Now Goldland, too...

179
00:17:49,999 --> 00:17:52,580
Prince Franz is in that castle, isn't he?

180
00:17:54,400 --> 00:17:55,400
Wait!

181
00:17:57,359 --> 00:18:00,876
I was looking for him, too. Take me to Franz!

182
00:18:01,379 --> 00:18:05,620
But your country and Goldland are currently at war!

183
00:18:05,969 --> 00:18:07,521
That doesn't matter!

184
00:18:07,869 --> 00:18:11,340
I love Franz. Love is all that matters.

185
00:18:11,604 --> 00:18:14,016
Come on, let's hurry and rescue him!

186
00:18:16,009 --> 00:18:18,420
All right, got it. We have no time to waste.

187
00:18:39,919 --> 00:18:43,600
You damn vampire bats, I won't go down that easily!

188
00:19:07,600 --> 00:19:10,840
Don't look down! Look up! Keep your eyes up and climb!

189
00:19:18,291 --> 00:19:22,145
Only one week left for Goldland. Silverland is next.

190
00:19:22,169 --> 00:19:25,292
I'll be counting on your cooperation then as well, King Charcoal.

191
00:19:25,606 --> 00:19:27,356
Of course.

192
00:19:28,497 --> 00:19:30,760
Now, if you'll excuse me.

193
00:19:36,829 --> 00:19:38,965
Well, we'll make him work as hard as possible.

194
00:19:39,052 --> 00:19:41,660
Work him to the bone, then toss him aside.

195
00:19:41,804 --> 00:19:44,520
That is the law of the X-Union.

196
00:19:57,009 --> 00:19:59,997
Oh dear... Papa is just being used.

197
00:20:01,459 --> 00:20:02,825
We're going to search for Prince Franz!

198
00:20:03,521 --> 00:20:05,969
Teppi, follow me!

199
00:20:24,220 --> 00:20:28,777
So cool! Do your best, Ribbon Knight!

200
00:20:38,220 --> 00:20:39,220
Are you all right?

201
00:20:40,119 --> 00:20:43,012
How wonderful... to be rescued by you...

202
00:20:43,260 --> 00:20:46,335
M-More importantly, I have to find Franz fast...

203
00:20:49,889 --> 00:20:53,455
Franz! Prince Franz, I've come to save you!

204
00:20:54,124 --> 00:20:55,660
Huh? That voice...

205
00:20:59,739 --> 00:21:03,686
Don't come in! There are vampire bats in here!

206
00:21:18,638 --> 00:21:21,325
Franz, we saved you!

207
00:21:22,719 --> 00:21:24,325
Saved by you again, huh?

208
00:21:56,920 --> 00:21:57,920
Catch!

209
00:22:20,399 --> 00:22:23,441
How wonderful the Ribbon Knight is...

210
00:22:24,735 --> 00:22:27,094
I think I'm falling for him.

211
00:22:43,287 --> 00:22:44,707
Thank you, Ribbon Knight.

212
00:22:44,958 --> 00:22:48,980
I'll hurry home and tell Papa to stop the war right away.

213
00:22:49,346 --> 00:22:51,080
And one more thing.

214
00:22:51,269 --> 00:22:54,960
Ribbon Knight... I, I...

215
00:22:55,159 --> 00:22:57,980
I've decided to become your wife!

216
00:23:00,569 --> 00:23:02,120
Franz, I'm sorry.

217
00:23:02,519 --> 00:23:05,700
But that's okay. You have Princess Sapphire, after all.

218
00:23:06,479 --> 00:23:10,940
No, I'm the one who's sorry. I... I love Sapphire.

219
00:23:12,020 --> 00:23:13,020
What's wrong?

220
00:23:13,374 --> 00:23:17,780
It's nothing. You'll understand when you're a bit older.

221
00:23:18,469 --> 00:23:21,040
Wait for me until I grow up!

222
00:23:21,224 --> 00:23:21,903
Promise me!

223
00:23:23,449 --> 00:23:26,496
Ribbon Knight! I love you!

224
00:24:08,380 --> 00:24:12,000
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

225
00:24:12,001 --> 00:24:15,361
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

226
00:24:15,362 --> 00:24:19,132
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

227
00:24:19,133 --> 00:24:22,294
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

228
00:24:22,295 --> 00:24:26,108
♪ Sen'nen man'nen hyakuman-nen ♪
A thousand years, ten thousand years, a million years,

229
00:24:26,109 --> 00:24:29,405
♪ Ribbon de tsunagou ichioku-nen ♪
Let’s connect with ribbons for a billion years!

230
00:24:29,406 --> 00:24:33,411
♪ Akuma ga kute mo arashi ga kute mo ♪
Even if demons come, even if storms arrive,

231
00:24:33,412 --> 00:24:36,850
♪ tsunaida kokoro wa hanarenai ♪
Our bonded hearts will never part.

232
00:24:36,851 --> 00:24:40,471
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

233
00:24:40,472 --> 00:24:43,832
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

234
